 '<details class="panel detail-body"><summary>'+t('Scope, service & recovery details','範圍、服務與恢復詳情')+'</summary><p class="small">'+t('A started service is not proof that a model is computing. Cancellation needs host confirmation.','服務已啟動不代表模型正在運算；取消仍需主機確認。')+'</p><ul>'+(service?.errors||[]).map(error=>'<li>'+escape(error)+'</li>').join('')+'</ul></details>';
